    family-names: "Krishna"

repository-code: "https://github.com/Akshaycyber006/QRVerse"

abstract: >
  QRVerse is a cross-platform smart QR platform that enables users to generate
  interactive QR cards for files, images, text, URLs, contacts, and Wi-Fi credentials,
  perform offline file transfers between nearby devices, organize digital content,
  and leverage AI-powered text recognition and translation.

keywords:
  - QR Code
  - File Sharing
  - Offline Transfer
  - OCR
  - AI Translation
  - Mobile Application
  - Expo
  - React Native
  - Supabase

